      4 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَعَكَّتْ</span></b> , said of a she-camel [when she has
conceived (see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عُكَّةٌ</span>)], (S, K,) or of such as is
termed <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عُشَرَآءُ</span> [q. v.], (TA,) <i>She assumed an
altered colour.</i> (S, K, TA.)

